('1','Requirements review','1-2','Project artifacts; resolve baseline decisions','Reviewed requirements / issue dispositions'),
('2','Test plan and schedule','1-2','Initial Card 1 scope; joint final review','Approved methods, owners and dates'),
('3','Test cases and fixtures','2-4','Reviewed Cards 1-2; environment readiness','Cases and synthetic data ready'),
