story += [H('Supporting checks available in the repository'),P('After the development environment and dependencies are configured, run the backend suite with python -m pytest backend/tests from the repository root. In the frontend directory, use npm test and npm run build. Record output, environment and build. Setup errors are distinguished from product defects. These commands are planned supporting checks and were not run to produce this document.'),H('Planning limitations'),P('No actual team calendar, member names, test environment details or signed requirements baseline were supplied. Consequently, actual assignments and dates remain editable, and the seventeen-day schedule and numerical targets require review. The plan makes no claim of live-system test completion, model accuracy, defect closure or deployment readiness.')]

